So Senate Bill 148FN was signed into law on August 10th, 2021.

313
00:16:18,000 --> 00:16:22,000
It took effect on September 1, 2022.

314
00:16:22,000 --> 00:16:27,000
And this bill requires all athletic departments to create and implement emergency action plans

315
00:16:27,000 --> 00:16:29,000
for sport-related injuries.

316
00:16:29,000 --> 00:16:34,000
The Timberlaine Athletic Department continues to collaborate with our athletic trainer as

317
00:16:34,000 --> 00:16:38,000
