319
00:16:42,000 --> 00:16:46,000
Coaches and student athletes from our middle school and high school teams are required to

320
00:16:46,000 --> 00:16:50,000
practice emergency drills in preparation for a traumatic incident.

321
00:16:50,000 --> 00:16:53,000
Coaches assign roles and responsibilities to members of the team.

322
00:16:53,000 --> 00:16:59,000
The athletic trainer coordinates drills for each team, and feedback is provided after each drill.

323
00:16:59,000 --> 00:17:04,000
We continue to assess our emergency action plan for relevance and best practices.

324
00:17:04,000 --> 00:17:09,000
The safety and security of our coaches, student athletes, and community members is our highest priority.

325
00:17:09,000 --> 00:17:14,000
We believe that this plan will help equip our student athletes to respond quickly and effectively

326
00:17:14,000 --> 00:17:16,000
in the event of an emergency.

