00:29:21,000 --> 00:29:27,000
to provide feedback in a more timely manner, and strengthen instruction.

629
00:29:27,000 --> 00:29:32,000
And then most importantly, it is a means to strengthen student-teacher relationships as well.

630
00:29:32,000 --> 00:29:35,000
So I know you have an executive summary.

