And that's not a critique of what you're doing, but it was a question I had for myself.

826
00:40:46,000 --> 00:40:48,000
The kids are definitely older.

827
00:40:48,000 --> 00:40:50,000
The teachers are on board with this.

828
00:40:50,000 --> 00:40:54,000
So I think those are all positive things.

829
00:40:54,000 --> 00:40:59,000
I don't agree with the fact that this is just a tweak.

