00:40:59,000 --> 00:41:03,000
The sixth graders won't be impacted at all because they are new to the middle school.

831
00:41:03,000 --> 00:41:08,000
So there's really no changes for them.

832
00:41:08,000 --> 00:41:09,000
It's not a tweak.

833
00:41:09,000 --> 00:41:14,000
It's it's a change in how you're delivering curriculum.

