I don't want to, if we were moving math from early in the morning to late in the afternoon or extending the lunch period or tweaking a schedule as, as that word is used regularly, then I would say yes.

863
00:43:37,000 --> 00:43:42,000
But this is the delivery of curriculum that affects every single student in the middle school.

