So the day tank.

1418
01:10:15,000 --> 01:10:16,000
What is a day tank?

1419
01:10:16,000 --> 01:10:19,000
A day tank is a tank that sits above the ground and sees the daytime.

1420
01:10:19,000 --> 01:10:23,000
So we've got one that's respective to the age of the building.

1421
01:10:23,000 --> 01:10:24,000
