1425
01:10:35,000 --> 01:10:40,000
And it's at a point of placement right now that not only our tech feels strongly about

1426
01:10:40,000 --> 01:10:44,000
what could possibly happen there in terms of fire, but we will not be able to get a signature on it

1427
01:10:44,000 --> 01:10:47,000
