1436
01:11:07,000 --> 01:11:10,000
Essentially it's a safety and environmental issue.

1437
01:11:10,000 --> 01:11:14,000
There's one tank outside with one lining, not two linings.

1438
01:11:14,000 --> 01:11:19,000
So if anything could fail or does fail, it would be quite problematic.

1439
01:11:19,000 --> 01:11:23,000
We are out of best practices.

1440
01:11:23,000 --> 01:11:26,000
Our chief for several years has said, hey, it should be better.

1441
01:11:26,000 --> 01:11:28,000
Improve it, but I'll sign off this year.

1442
01:11:28,000 --> 01:11:29,000
He's done that a couple of times.

1443
01:11:29,000 --> 01:11:32,000
And at this point he's saying, I'm no longer signing off.

1444
01:11:32,000 --> 01:11:34,000
It needs to be done one way or the other.

1445
01:11:34,000 --> 01:11:40,000
Unlike other building ordinances, the fire, when it comes to fire and safety,

1446
01:11:40,000 --> 01:11:44,000
