1447
01:11:44,000 --> 01:11:48,000
So in his opinion, it is his purview.

1448
01:11:48,000 --> 01:11:52,000
And he's been generous in, you know, stretching it and allowing, you know,

1449
01:11:52,000 --> 01:11:54,000
allowing to go through for the past several years.

1450
01:11:54,000 --> 01:11:56,000
It's a 20-plus year old tank.

1451
01:11:56,000 --> 01:11:57,000
He's not willing to do it anymore.

1452
01:11:57,000 --> 01:12:02,000
This is a must, not a want, unfortunately.

1453
01:12:02,000 --> 01:12:03,000
All right.

1454
01:12:03,000 --> 01:12:11,000
