2620
02:25:15,740 --> 02:25:21,060
It drips down, and if you have wood, which we do for our sills, the wood rots, gets dry rot.

2621
02:25:21,440 --> 02:25:28,940
So this is some man hours, some maintenance that our maintenance staff has to address on a yearly basis.

2622
02:25:28,940 --> 02:25:44,180
